19
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:32,000
[Text: こんばんわ 風真いろはです。]
[Text: Good evening, I am Kazama Iroha.]

20
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:57,500
[Text: 今日は3周年おいわい感謝]
[Text: Gratitude for our 3rd anniversary celebration today]

21
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:14,000
[Text: 来てくれて本当にありがとう！]
[Text: Thank you so much for coming!]

22
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:45,000
[Text: 最初に皆さんに少しだけお話をさせて下さい]
[Text: Please let me talk to everyone for a little bit first]

23
00:05:01,608 --> 00:05:31,965
[Text: お案しのとおりですが、今、声が出ません。]
[Text: As you might have guessed, I can't speak right now.]

24
00:05:32,465 --> 00:06:25,115
[Text: 原因は端的に言うとストレスからくる心因性失声症です。]
[Text: To put it simply, the cause is psychogenic aphonia brought on by stress.]

25
00:06:26,415 --> 00:06:58,765
[Text: お医者さんに診断いただきました。]
[Text: I was diagnosed by a doctor.]

26
00:07:00,115 --> 00:07:42,515
[Text: 端的な説明すぎて誤解を招きたくないので、はっきり言うと]
[Text: Since a brief explanation might lead to misunderstandings, to be completely clear...]

27
00:07:43,915 --> 00:08:22,515
[Text: クロエの卒業とは関係ないというか]
[Text: It has nothing to do with Chloe's graduation...]

28
00:08:27,415 --> 00:08:40,415
[Text: もちろんすごくさみしいです]
[Text: Of course, I'm extremely sad about it.]

29
00:08:42,415 --> 00:09:04,915
[Text: 正直今日の配信は前から不安でした]
[Text: To be honest, I've been feeling anxious about today's stream for a while.]

30
00:09:06,115 --> 00:09:50,015
[Text: でもそれだけが原因ではなく、本当に誰か悪いとかないです。]
[Text: But that's not the only reason, and there really is no one to blame.]

31
00:10:00,032 --> 00:10:25,016
[Text: 他のこともふくめ、心に負荷がかかりすぎた。]
[Text: Including other things, too much stress weighed on my mind.]

32
00:10:26,516 --> 00:10:44,516
[Text: それだけです。タイミングとかもある。]
[Text: That's all. Timing and other factors played a part too.]

33
00:10:46,016 --> 00:11:12,516
[Text: でも全部仕方ない。誰も悪くない。]
[Text: But it can't be helped. No one is to blame.]

34
00:11:13,516 --> 00:11:20,516
[Text: しいて言えば]
[Text: If anything,]

35
00:11:21,516 --> 00:11:36,016
[Text: 己が弱い
←これです。]
[Text: I'm just weak
← This is it.]

36
00:11:38,516 --> 00:12:15,516
[Text: 明日、声が出るかもだ
ずっと出ないかもだし
わかりませんが]
[Text: My voice might come back tomorrow,
or it might not come back at all,
I don't know, but]

37
00:12:16,516 --> 00:12:57,516
[Text: 今日は絶対
皆を１人にしたくなくてわがまま言って配信してます]
[Text: Today I was selfish and decided to stream
because I absolutely didn't want to leave everyone all alone.]

38
00:13:02,516 --> 00:13:26,516
[Text: ご心配をおかけして本当にごめんなさい！]
[Text: I'm so, so sorry for worrying you!]

39
00:13:33,016 --> 00:14:10,016
[Text: 今日は楽しい気持ちを沢山皆さんと共有したくて]
[Text: Because I wanted to share lots of happy feelings with everyone today,]

40
